                        <section class="stack _bf4e9d50 stack--content-width-default stack--vertical-top stack--mobile-vertical-top custom-stack design-editable-stack content-editable-stack nstrs-wpno0 nsdrs-xh0jd nscrs-bcp3o" data-id="9851ea0f-540b-44e6-9af2-f5450a46aa65"><div class="stack-inner _dbf617b7"><div class="column-container _5d5af514 column-container--has-more-settings"><div class="column _1100af70 _4993ced5 _4993ced5--dd6cb30e _1100af70--dd6cb30e _b45e4f82 nclrs-o1gev" data-column="1" id="column_1_stack_910612" data-unique-id="nclrs-o1gev"><div class="block nblrs-r4vsk _3169c105 _e051869c _ccf061ef _ccf061ef--e21bb0a1 _6d30e4c5" data-id="6627516" data-uuid="a0742acb-f63f-4450-9320-8994441e0399" data-block="nblrs-r4vsk" data-block-type="button" data-content-revision="1">        <a class="_3f7c9771 _3f7c9771--e21bb0a1" role="button" tabindex="0" href="/free-quote--booking/" >BOOK YOUR FREE QUOTE</a></div></div><div class="column _1100af70 _4993ced5 _4993ced5--e8a6d732 _1100af70--e8a6d732 _b45e4f82 nclrs-6o1ky" data-column="2" id="column_2_stack_910612" data-unique-id="nclrs-6o1ky"><div class="block nblrs-ndeem _3169c105 _e051869c _ccf061ef _ccf061ef--e21bb0a1 _6d30e4c5" data-id="6627518" data-uuid="a0742acc-2845-46a5-aebb-d31cc584115e" data-block="nblrs-ndeem" data-block-type="button" data-content-revision="1">        <a class="_3f7c9771 _3f7c9771--e21bb0a1" role="button" tabindex="0" href="/contact-us/" >BOOK A SERVICE</a></div></div></div></div></section><section class="stack _bf4e9d50 stack--content-width-default stack--vertical-top stack--mobile-vertical-top custom-stack design-editable-stack content-editable-stack nstrs-8f7ib nsdrs-g0rad nscrs-mb3g3" data-id="9851e5e5-03e8-43a2-9689-96545755b457"><div class="stack-inner _dbf617b7"><div class="column-container _5d5af514 column-container--has-more-settings"><div class="column _1100af70 _4993ced5 _4993ced5--36a945c2 _1100af70--36a945c2 _b45e4f82 nclrs-huzvm" data-column="1" id="column_1_stack_169271" data-unique-id="nclrs-huzvm"><div class="block nblrs-blo5t text_block _6d30e4c5" data-id="693173" data-uuid="999e0776-391d-4f86-bd8f-b372c6eab78d" data-block="nblrs-blo5t" data-block-type="text" data-content-revision="1"><div class="block_content_container"><div class="heading-container"><h1 class="heading text-center"><strong>Wellington’s professional heat pump installation company&nbsp;</strong></h1></div>    <div class="text_block_text p-font p-font-all text-padding">        <p class="p-font text-center"><strong>We are a Wellington-based air conditioning and heat pump servicing business that provides reliable, quality services. Professionals with a focus on customer service, you can rely on us for all your ducted heat pump installation for homes and commercial businesses. people skills. Experts in the trade, so You can depend on us to give you the right advice for your situation. So whether it's </strong><a target="_self" rel="noopener" type="page" href="/commercial-heat-pumps"><strong>commercial air conditioning</strong></a><strong>&nbsp;heating or home heating you’re after or even electrical work, just give us a call.</strong></p><p class="p-font text-center"><a target="_self" rel="noopener" type="page" href="/contact-us"><strong>Contact us</strong></a><strong> today to find out more about our heat pump deals. We work across Wellington, Upper and Lower Hutt, Porirua, and the Kapiti Coast. Click Here To Read More About Us</strong></p>    </div></div></div><div class="block nblrs-isjfl _3169c105 _e051869c _ccf061ef _ccf061ef--90078e80 _6d30e4c5" data-id="6627544" data-uuid="a0742ace-72e6-4f37-a643-bb633fa887ea" data-block="nblrs-isjfl" data-block-type="button" data-content-revision="1">        <a class="_3f7c9771 _3f7c9771--90078e80" role="button" tabindex="0" href="/about/" >Click Here To Read More About Us</a></div></div><div class="column _1100af70 _4993ced5 _4993ced5--41ee4ea8 _1100af70--41ee4ea8 _b45e4f82 nclrs-noz60 column--no-blocks _461bbdfa" data-column="2" id="column_2_stack_169271" data-unique-id="nclrs-noz60"></div></div></div></section><section class="stack _bf4e9d50 stack--content-width-default stack--vertical-top stack--mobile-vertical-top custom-stack design-editable-stack content-editable-stack nstrs-8ctyf nsdrs-4zqex nscrs-kcw6p" data-id="9851e96c-01be-4e86-bfce-fe17c0b883ab"><div class="stack-inner _dbf617b7"><div class="column-container _5d5af514 column-container--has-more-settings"><div class="column _1100af70 _4993ced5 _4993ced5--2efafb6c _1100af70--2efafb6c _b45e4f82 nclrs-egaf1 column--no-blocks _461bbdfa" data-column="1" id="column_1_stack_785340" data-unique-id="nclrs-egaf1"></div></div></div></section><section class="stack _bf4e9d50 stack--content-width-default stack--vertical-top stack--mobile-vertical-top custom-stack design-editable-stack content-editable-stack nstrs-ppzic nsdrs-2chg1 nscrs-gqaae" data-id="9851e5d6-5449-4215-8f1c-d50aecc13f4b"><div class="stack-inner _dbf617b7"><div class="column-container _5d5af514 column-container--has-more-settings"><div class="column _1100af70 _4993ced5 _4993ced5--0ce7617e _1100af70--0ce7617e _b45e4f82 nclrs-2iihl" data-column="1" id="column_1_stack_157061" data-unique-id="nclrs-2iihl"><div class="block nblrs-zpqdw text_block _6d30e4c5" data-id="667946" data-uuid="999e0758-d2ee-46dd-9b57-e1246ddd179e" data-block="nblrs-zpqdw" data-block-type="text" data-content-revision="1"><div class="block_content_container"><div class="heading-container"><h3 class="heading typekit-element ">"Excellent work"</h3></div>    <div class="text_block_text p-font p-font-all text-padding">        <p>"We had five companies give us quotes to install two heat pumps in our house. Beni gave us the second best price, but the best vibe. When he came, he clearly knew his stuff. We decided to go with him. Plus, he was able to do complete the job within the time frame we needed.&nbsp;</p><p>He and his crew took care of the installation in 1.5 days. They left the place tidy, and they always communicated what they were doing and why. BA Heat Pumps come with our recommendation!"</p><p><em>Lance Mosher</em></p>    </div></div></div><div class="block nblrs-zjhtj text_block _6d30e4c5" data-id="697140" data-uuid="999e077b-0bb5-4019-94d0-10b2a78521f0" data-block="nblrs-zjhtj" data-block-type="text" data-content-revision="1"><div class="block_content_container"><div class="heading-container"><h3 class="heading typekit-element  align-center">Our passion translates to a positive outcome with our customers...</h3></div>    <div class="text_block_text p-font p-font-all">            </div></div></div></div><div class="column _1100af70 _4993ced5 _4993ced5--f0d9289c _1100af70--f0d9289c _b45e4f82 nclrs-dixrz" data-column="2" id="column_2_stack_157061" data-unique-id="nclrs-dixrz"><div class="block nblrs-gsv8d text_block _6d30e4c5" data-id="667947" data-uuid="999e0758-d3b4-416a-8c8a-db1b78a29fab" data-block="nblrs-gsv8d" data-block-type="text" data-content-revision="1"><div class="block_content_container"><div class="heading-container"><h3 class="heading typekit-element ">"Totally recommend this business!"</h3></div>    <div class="text_block_text p-font p-font-all text-padding">        <p>"Beni absolutely rocks and really knows his stuff! Our old heatpump died (slowly over a number of months), and Beni was really upfront about options. The best one turned out to be a brand new one with higher output, and we couldn't be happier. The service was excellent with fast, efficient delivery and installation."</p><p><em>Catherine Rozendaal</em></p>    </div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="stack _bf4e9d50 stack--content-width-default stack--vertical-top stack--mobile-vertical-top custom-stack design-editable-stack content-editable-stack nstrs-o1t0s nsdrs-ep8rz nscrs-hoii3" data-id="9851e5d6-550b-4704-a143-071aa3b3b93e"><div class="background-image lazy-load stack--hide-background-image"></div><div class="stack-inner _dbf617b7"><div class="column-container