">    <div class="_01cee16c _01cee16c--52e13e35">                <a href="/heat-pumps/" class="_26f697c8">                        <img class="_ac00c56e _ac00c56e--52e13e35" data-sizes="w400h282,w1200h848,w2400h1697" data-src="https://dzpdbgwih7u1r.cloudfront.net/96a712ee-8250-4561-a556-34302040bad0/9c6fb0ff-bc48-4d9b-9bfb-618616172de6/9c6fb0ff-bed4-4276-a9c3-ab8db743b6a7/w2400h1697-18f456a1f75987b0daa19f917d4d6373.png" alt="" width="100%">                    </a>            </div></div></div></div><div class="column _1100af70 _4993ced5 _4993ced5--4089c317 _1100af70--4089c317 _b45e4f82 nclrs-tlnsr" data-column="2" id="column_2_stack_169260" data-unique-id="nclrs-tlnsr"><div class="block nblrs-18cbb picture_block _6d30e4c5" data-id="892280" data-uuid="999e08b1-70d5-466d-8f8d-a2122a8a0c9b" data-block="nblrs-18cbb" data-block-type="image" data-content-revision="1"><div class="block_content_container"><span class="picture_block_holder"><div id="picture-892280" class="picture picture-892280 position-center hover-none shape-square filter-none align-center fx-enabled hover-fx-enabled sync-overlay sync-border" ><div class="picture_block_holder__spacer"></div><a class="gtm-event "  data-event="Click" data-event-category="Image" data-event-label="Page: home - LinkTo:/page/gree-heat-pumps/" href="/page/gree-heat-pumps/" target=""><picture>  <source data-srcset="https://pictures.rs-cdn.com/CF-a126d912-36d2-46f0-bb80-8af52b30ce72/trim=0;0;3;0,fit=cover,gravity=auto,width=492,height=122,sharpen=0.70/24dadff63b9bf1078135284f4970e18a.png, https://pictures.rs-cdn.com/CF-a126d912-36d2-46f0-bb80-8af52b30ce72/trim=0;0;3;0,fit=cover,gravity=auto,width=492,height=122,dpr=2,sharpen=0.20/24dadff63b9bf1078135284f4970e18a.png 2x" media="(min-width: 1460px)">  <source data-srcset="https://pictures.rs-cdn.com/CF-a126d912-36d2-46f0-bb80-8af52b30ce72/trim=0;0;3;0,fit=cover,gravity=auto,width=412,height=102,sharpen=0.78/24dadff63b9bf1078135284f4970e18a.png, https://pictures.rs-cdn.com/CF-a126d912-36d2-46f0-bb80-8af52b30ce72/trim=0;0;3;0,fit=cover,gravity=auto,width=412,height=102,dpr=2,sharpen=0.36/24dadff63b9bf1078135284f4970e18a.png 2x" media="(min-width: 1080px) AND (max-width: 1460px)">  <source data-srcset="https://pictures.rs-cdn.com/CF-a126d912-36d2-46f0-bb80-8af52b30ce72/trim=0;4;3;0,fit=cover,gravity=auto,width=310,height=77,sharpen=0.89/24dadff63b9bf1078135284f4970e18a.png, https://pictures.rs-cdn.com/CF-a126d912-36d2-46f0-bb80-8af52b30ce72/trim=0;4;3;0,fit=cover,gravity=auto,width=310,height=77,dpr=2,sharpen=0.57/24dadff63b9bf1078135284f4970e18a.png 2x" media="(min-width: 740px) AND (max-width: 1080px)">  <source data-srcset="https://pictures.rs-cdn.com/CF-a126d912-36d2-46f0-bb80-8af52b30ce72/trim=0;0;2;0,fit=cover,gravity=auto,width=511,height=127,sharpen=0.68/24dadff63b9bf1078135284f4970e18a.png, https://pictures.rs-cdn.com/CF-a126d912-36d2-46f0-bb80-8af52b30ce72/trim=0;0;2;0,fit=cover,gravity=auto,width=511,height=127,dpr=2,sharpen=0.16/24dadff63b9bf1078135284f4970e18a.png 2x" media="(max-width: 740px)">  <source data-srcset="https://pictures.rs-cdn.com/CF-a126d912-36d2-46f0-bb80-8af52b30ce72/trim=0;0;3;0,fit=cover,gravity=auto,width=331,height=82,sharpen=0.86/24dadff63b9bf1078135284f4970e18a.png, https://pictures.rs-cdn.com/CF-a126d912-36d2-46f0-bb80-8af52b30ce72/trim=0;0;3;0,fit=cover,gravity=auto,width=331,height=82,dpr=2,sharpen=0.53/24dadff63b9bf1078135284f4970e18a.png 2x" media="(max-width: 400px)">  <img data-src="https://pictures.rs-cdn.com/CF-a126d912-36d2-46f0-bb80-8af52b30ce72/trim=0;0;3;0,fit=cover,gravity=auto,width=412,height=102,sharpen=0.78/24dadff63b9bf1078135284f4970e18a.png"  data-block-id="892280" alt="" class="partial-width-image lazy-load"></picture></a></div></span></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="stack _bf4e9d50 stack--content-width-default stack--vertical-top stack--mobile-vertical-top custom-stack design-editable-stack content-editable-stack nstrs-ynfnf nsdrs-gejbd nscrs-cdjxs" data-id="9851e7bd-9599-4cd1-ad4b-594bfbe3a9be"><div class="stack-inner _dbf617b7"><div class="column-container _5d5af514 column-container--has-more-settings"><div class="column _1100af70 _4993ced5 _4993ced5--0a2f3d0e _1100af70--0a2f3d0e _b45e4f82 nclrs-uw8fp" data-column="1" id="column_1_stack_494729" data-unique-id="nclrs-uw8fp"><div class="block nblrs-aj7to text_block _6d30e4c5" data-id="1467040" data-uuid="999e2490-a519-4032-bef6-a158a5e09dbd" data-block="nblrs-aj7to" data-block-type="text" data-content-revision="1"><div class="block_content_container">    <div class="text_block_text p-font p-font-all">        <h1 class="heading">Heat Pumps in Porirua, Kapiti, &amp; the Wider Wellington Region</h1><p class="p-font"></p><p class="p-font">At BA Heat Pumps Electrical Division Ltd, we provide a full range of heating ventilation &amp; air conditioning services. This includes installing and servicing heat pumps in throughout Wellington, Porirua, Kapiti, or anywhere in the North Island. We also offer ventilation and air conditioning servicing and installation.</p><p class="p-font">The heat pumps we install come from leading brands such as Toshiba and Fujitsu plus we install air conditioners from brands like Gree.</p><p class="p-font">Our maintenance services are available for most brands of heat pump or air conditioning unit.</p><p class="p-font">To get a quote for the services you need, including for heat pumps wherever you are in Porirua, Kapiti, or Wellington, please email us or text us your details (Name, Address of your Property, and the best time to do a site visit) on 0800 22 88 44.</p><p class="p-font"></p><h2 class="heading">Cooling, Air Conditioning, and Commercial Heating Solutions in Wellington</h2><p class="p-font"></p><p class="p-font">We offer high-wall, floor, and ducted heat pump installation throughout Wellington or anywhere in the North Island. The heat pumps we install are energy efficient, have sleek designs, and come with a range of features to improve performance, lower running costs, and give you greater control. You’ll find what you need in our range of heating solutions in Wellington.</p><p class="p-font">We also offer energy-efficient, reliable, and affordable ventilation and air conditioning solutions. Please contact us today to discuss your requirements.</p><p class="p-font"></p><h2 class="heading">Heat Pump Installation &amp; Servicing in Wellington</h2><p class="p-font"></p><p class="p-font">We offer heat pump servicing in Wellington too, both on heat pumps that we install as well as heat pumps installed by other companies. When you come to us, you’ll get a reliable service with fast turnaround time, plus our prices are competitive.</p><p class="p-font">Our workmanship is second to none to give you peace of mind that your heat pump is running as it should be.</p><p class="p-font">If you have a problem with your heat pump or air conditioning unit, we offer repair services too.</p><p class="p-font">Contact us on 0800 22 88 44 or send us an email at &#111;&#102;&#102;&#105;&#99;&#101;&#64;&#98;&#97;&#104;&#101;&#97;&#116;&#112;&#117;&#109;&#112;&#115;&#46;&#99;&#111;&#46;&#110;&#122; to book a callout from one of our experienced, trained, and qualified technicians.</p><p class="p-font">View More</p><h3 class="heading">Ducted Heat Pumps Installation &amp; Servicing Kapiti and Wellington</h3><p class="p-font">From a fully climate-controlled solution to a simpler but still highly effective system, a ducted heat pump solution is the best way to keep your home comfortable all year round.</p><p class="p-font">When you choose a ducted heat pump in Wellington, the system will be highly discreet as all the workings are hidden away behind your walls and ceilings. As a result, the system will be barely visible.</p><p class="p-font">While you won’t really see it, you will recognise the effect as a ducted heat pump solution will ensure your home is cool in our Wellington summers and warm when the winter months set in and the temperatures get colder. Get in touch with us today to find out more.</p><p class="p-font"></p><h3 class="heading">Floor, Ceiling, &amp; Wall Mounted Heat Pumps in Wellington, Porirua, &amp; Kapiti</h3><p class="p-font">At B A Heat Pumps Electrical Division Ltd, we supply and install a full range of heat pumps in the Wellington, Porirua, and Kapiti areas. This includes ceiling, floor, and wall-mounted heat pumps.</p><p class="p-font">There are advantages and disadvantages to each option. For example, a ceiling unit will be less visible and leaves your walls free, while wall-mounted heat pumps are generally more efficient at heating your rooms.</p><p class="p-font">Our team will be able to assess your rooms and requirements in addition to the heating solutions that are available, before making a recommendation on what is best for your Wellington home.</p><p class="p-font">To speak to a member of our team about heating solutions and heat pump installation in Wellington, please call us today on 0800 22 88 44.</p><p class="p-font"></p><h3 class="heading">Commercial Heating Solutions in Wellington, Porirua, &amp; Kapiti</h3><p class="p-font">At B A Heat Pumps Electrical Division Ltd, we also offer multi-room heat pump installation services in Wellington. A customised and well-planned multi-room solution can save you money as you will need fewer outdoor units. Fewer outdoor units also mean less space taken up on your external walls.</p><p class="p-font">As mentioned, though, it is important the system is properly planned and then properly installed. This is where we come in with our expert multi-room heat pump installation services in Wellington. Give us a call today to get a free, no-obligation quote.</p><p class="p-font">Heat Pump Repairs</p><p class="p-font">If you have a problem with your heat pump that needs to be repaired, please get in touch with us:</p><p class="p-font">We offer fast turnaround times on repair requests, returning comfort levels to your home sooner rather than later</p><p class="p-font">We work on all makes and model of heat pump</p><p class="p-font">Most repairs can be completed in a single visit</p><p class="p-font">You’ll get a competitive price for heat pump repairs</p><p class="p-font">Call today on 0800 22 88 44 to book a callout with one of our HVAC technicians.</p><p class="p-font"></p><h3 class="heading">Heat Pump Servicing in Wellington</h3><p class="p-font">Contact us at B A Heat Pumps Electrical Division Ltd if you need heat pump servicing in Wellington. We service all makes and models of heat pumps and will ensure yours is in good working condition. Our maintenance services follow all manufacturer guidelines, plus we can often identify potential faults before they occur and stop your heat pump from working.</p><p class="p-font">Call us now on 0800 22 88 44 to book your next heat pump service in Wellington.</p><p class="p-font">Air Conditioning Services</p><p class="p-font">In New Zealand, heat pumps and air conditioning units are the same thing. So, when we refer to heat pumps and related services, we are referring to air conditioning services too. In other words, heat pump servicing in Wellington is the same as air conditioning unit servicing.</p><p class="p-font">So, whatever air conditioning services you are looking for, get in touch with us.</p><p class="p-font">Electrical Services</p><p class="p-font">At B A Heat Pumps Electrical Division Ltd, we have experienced electricians on our team. They spend a lot of their time installing, servicing, and repairing heat pumps, but we also offer electrical services to our customers as they know and trust the quality standards and affordable prices that we provide.</p><p class="p-font">To discuss your electrical needs with a member of our team, and to get a quote, please call us on 0800 22 88 44.</p><p class="p-font">Solar Solutions</p><p class="p-font">If you would like to find out more about installing solar panels in your home, as well as the costs involved and the energy savings you will make, please get in touch with us by calling 0800 22 88 44.</p><p class="p-font">Security System Solutions</p><p class="p-font">Installing and upgrading security solutions is another of our key specialties at BA Heat Pumps. We can help with alarms, CCTV, and a range of other security solutions, so get in touch with us.</p><p class="p-font">Getting the Most Out of Your Heat Pump to Keep Your Home Warm in Winter and Cool in Summer</p><p class="p-font">We often don’t give much thought to our heat pump – until it stops working properly, that is. However, there are things you can do to maximise the performance of your heat pump, reduce costs, and keep your home comfortable all year round. Here are our 10 tips for getting the most out of your heat pump.</p><p class="p-font"></p><ul><li><p class="p-font">Install the right heat pump. There is a wide range of heat pumps to choose from, so it’s important you get a model suitable for the space and features of your home/rooms as well as your budget.</p></li></ul><ul><li><p class="p-font">Install the heat pump in the right location, taking into consideration how people use the space, where the furniture is located, etc.</p></li></ul><ul><li><p class="p-font">Understand the different modes and features of your heat pump and make sure you know how to use them.</p></li></ul><ul><li><p class="p-font">Get your heat pump serviced regularly. In almost all situations, you should get your heat pump serviced once a year.</p></li></ul><ul><li><p class="p-font">Clean your heat pump filters between services by vacuuming them.</p></li></ul><ul><li><p class="p-font">Utilise the time and climate control functions of your heat pump rather than running it continuously. This will ensure your rooms are warm/cool when you need them to be.</p></li></ul><ul><li><p class="p-font">Use the zoning functionality of your heat pump, so it only runs in the required rooms.</p></li></ul><ul><li><p class="p-font">In the summer, keep blinds and curtains closed to prevent the heat of the sun from getting in, while doing the opposite in the winter.</p></li></ul><ul><li><p class="p-font">In the summer, open doors and windows, particularly at cooler times of the day, to get cool air flowing through the house.</p></li></ul><ul><li><p class="p-font">Make sure your home is well insulated to keep warm air in during the winter and hot air out during the summer.</p></li></ul>    </div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="stack _bf4e9d50 stack--content-width-default stack--vertical-top stack--mobile-vertical-top custom-stack design-editable-stack content-editable-stack nstrs-gfy4s nsdrs-xjahh nscrs-5krpp stack--design-linked" data-id="9851ea08-f52a-4635-bb42-730e9780e200"><div class="stack-inner _dbf617b7"><div class="column-container _5d5af514 column-container--has-more-settings"><div class="column _1100af70 _4993ced5 _4993ced5--58d7ee64 _1100af70--58d7ee64 _b45e4f82 nclrs-qjm1r column--no-blocks _461bbdfa" data-column="1" id="column_1_stack_904788" data-unique-id="nclrs-qjm1r"></div></div></div></section><section class="stack _bf4e9d50 stack--content-width-default stack--vertical-top stack--mobile-vertical-top custom-stack design-editable-stack content-editable-stack nstrs-qndcw nsdrs-paca3 nscrs-87azb stack--footer _6a88ef4e" data-id="9851e5e4-fdef-4f34-bea2-e615d767f5a0"><div class="stack-inner _dbf617b7"><div class="column-container _5d5af514 column-container--has-more-settings"><div class="column _1100af70 _4993ced5 _4993ced5--3b1fecd0 _1100af70--3b1fecd0 _b45e4f82 nclrs-a2azi column--has-spacing column--has-no-top-bottom-spacing" data-column="1" id="column_1_stack_169248" data-unique-id="nclrs-a2azi"><div class="block nblrs-7kq33 text_block _6d30e4c5" data-id="667667" data-uuid="999e0758-75c5-446c-9548-fc712445edcc" data-block="nblrs-7kq33" data-block-type="text" data-content-revision="1"><div class="block_content_container"><div class="heading-container"><h3 class="heading">Heating &amp; Cooling</h3></div>    <div class="text_block_text p-font p-font-all text-padding">        <p class="p-font"><a target="_self" rel="noopener" type="page" href="/heat-pumps">Heat Pumps<br>Heat Pump Installation</a><br><a target="_self" rel="noopener" type="page" href="/ducted-heat-pumps">Ducted Heat Pumps</a><br><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" type="page" href="/page/services">Heat Transfer Systems<br>Air Conditioning<br>Repairs &amp; Servicing</a><br><a target="_self" rel="noopener" type="page" href="/free-quote--booking">Free quotes &amp; assessments</a><br></p>    </div></div></div><div class="block nblrs-2j2s8 text_block _6d30e4c5" data-id="693084" data-uuid="999e0776-195e-4a99-a3da-39a1c3b88d95" data-block="nblrs-2j2s8" data-block-type="text" data-content-revision="1"><div class="block_content_container"><div class="heading-container"><h3 class="heading">Heat Pump Supply</h3></div>    <div class="text_block_text p-font p-font-all text-padding">        <p class="p-font"><a target="_self" rel="noopener" type="page" href="/hot-deals">Fujitsu Heat Pumps</a><br><a target="_self" rel="noopener" type="page" href="/page/gree-heat-pumps">Gree&nbsp;Heat Pumps</a></p>    </div></div></div><div class="block nblrs-0iebq text_block _6d30e4c5" data-id="667665" data-uuid="999e0758-7410-4e1c-b687-7f6ed7405841" data-block="nblrs-0iebq" data-block-type="text" data-content-revision="1"><div class="block_content_container"><div class="heading-container"><h3 class="heading typekit-element ">Solar</h3></div>    <div class="text_block_text p-font p-font-all text-padding">        <p><a href="/page/services">Heating & Water Heating<br>Solar Panel Installation</a></p>    </div></div></div></div><div class="column _1100af70 _4993ced5 _4993ced5--65775986 _1100af70--65775986 _b45e4f82 nclrs-3mzjk column--has-spacing column--has-no-top-bottom-spacing" data-column="2" id="column_2_stack_169248" data-unique-id="nclrs-3mzjk"><div class="block nblrs-gav55 text_block _6d30e4c5" data-i